{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9039de3e-9147-89f2-b8ed-bac075a0fbb3",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T08:58:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivan Brito",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:54:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:54:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning. Yeah, my recycling bin got broken by the truck. The lid's cracked clean off and one of the wheels is gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:55:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry to hear that. When did this happen? Was it this morning's pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:55:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the blue one, the big one with the wheels. Well, no, you asked when. Friday. Friday morning, they picked up on my street Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:55:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Friday, got it. So the driver, or the lift arm, I'm guessing, did the damage. Did you see it happen or just find it after?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:55:33-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Found it after. It was lying in the street, down on its side, lid maybe ten feet away. [pause] Sorry, hold on, I'm making eggs and the pan is going. Let me move it off the burner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:55:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, go ahead. I'm writing down Friday, blue recycling bin, cracked lid, missing wheel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:55:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Back. Yeah, that's right. The pan's still sizzling a little, you might hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:56:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear it, that's fine. So what would you like us to do? Replace the bin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:56:09-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I do want a new bin, yes. But mainly I'd like a supervisor to call me back. This is the second time they've handled it rough, and I'd like somebody to talk to the driver. No, wait, I said second time. It's the second bin of mine, not the second time I called. I never called before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:56:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so second damaged bin, first call. Got it. I can put in the replacement request and send a note up to the supervisor to call you. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0161. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:56:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-one. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:56:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ivan Brito. B-R-I-T-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:56:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ivan Brito. And I'll need the street address for the pickup so they can match it to the route."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:56:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the route. It's, um, Monday and Friday pickup for me. Oh, you want the address. I'd rather just have the supervisor take that when he calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:57:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay, I'll note that they should confirm the address on the callback. When are you usually around?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mornings are best. Till about noon I'm home. After that I'm in and out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:57:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mornings, until noon. I'll flag it that way. Supervisors are usually pretty good about getting back within a day or two, but I'll mark it as a callback request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:57:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. And in the meantime, do I just leave the bin out or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Keep it for now so they can see the damage. Don't put it out on the curb for the next pickup, just hold on to it until they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:57:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll keep it in the garage then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:57:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Anything else I can help with, Ivan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:58:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks for taking it down. I'm gonna go save my eggs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, enjoy. Have a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T08:58:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
